# Curses, Foiled A-Golem!? (windurst 63): Mind Hoarder's death handler. Mind Hoarder (17612859) is a lottery NM: its
# spawn slot (feiyin/mobs.yaml) holds the placeholder Clockwork Pod 17612857 (MIND_HOARDER-2) and the NM at a 15%
# chance. Each kill of the placeholder opens the slot's lottery; at the slot's next spawn the engine's RNG rolls for the
# NM (SpawnSlot.TrySpawn). With the harness's pinned seed the three placeholder rounds below (kill, then 2 x 310 s:
# the placeholder is not back after the first 310 s) leave Mind Hoarder up after the last tick (quest rework P9, D1:
# each kill claims its mob, so no kill may find the placeholder's body). The mobs' recasts expire since 8da64d7f, which
# moves the RNG draws: the ten rounds it took before now find the NM up from the fourth. The quest accepted by GM at
# Prog 1, no spell held during the rounds (the placeholder is a Clockwork Pod, whose own handler would take the New
# Spell); then Shantotto's New Spell by GM and the Mind Hoarder kill: the New Spell taken, the Ex-Spell given.
lists Feiyin/onEventFinish/14
char zone=Feiyin pos=-182.5,-2.0,190.0 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Windurst.CursesFoiledAgain1 completed
quest Windurst.CursesFoiledAgain2 completed
quest Windurst.CursesFoiledAGolem accepted
charvar Quest[2][63]Prog 1
login
kill MIND_HOARDER-2                                 # the placeholder (round 1)
tick 310000
tick 310000
kill MIND_HOARDER-2                                 # the placeholder (round 2)
tick 310000
tick 310000
kill MIND_HOARDER-2                                 # the placeholder (round 3)
tick 310000
tick 310000
keyitem ShantottosNewSpell
kill MIND_HOARDER                                   # the New Spell held: taken; Shantotto's Ex-Spell
